# Private scratch space. Anything Jekyll does not recognise at the top level is
# copied verbatim into _site and served publicly, so keep working documents
# (CV drafts, notes) both untracked here and excluded in _config.yml. The
# published CV is assets/pdf/CV-WeiqingChen.pdf.
cv_work/

# Full-resolution video masters. The site serves the re-encoded 720p copies in
